{
  "module": "kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "46fdffd92d3c823adcf92a65c0600e03",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "s_r_lunch",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "s_r_lunch",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "bccc9e7c621f3619559a46b84aef4cb32b223ec5ae2c9626a3ac3ed6860aa649",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "%YOU% と %CHARA% は屋上で弁当を交換することにしていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "52e236739fee1445f526ff539fa2e47e",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "s_r_lunch",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "s_r_lunch",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "c2dbb050c449ffd580c2946f533d143306db5410501627e18c89ccc73bdba9e8",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "スズカの弁当を受け取った %YOU% は、色も香りも整った料理に目を奪われ、つい食べ進めてしまう。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9d353de1858f3abdd2f1bd71821bcabe",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "s_r_lunch",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "s_r_lunch",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "be55570810d7c94e2c2dc592295092ed095ee86df55fd886bff6ba236c4afd96",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "スズカは %YOU% の弁当を丁寧に味わいながら、時おり、その食べっぷりを微笑ましそうに見つめていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "75594502b56958b10b0005d4af7d3f98",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "s_r_lunch",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "s_r_lunch",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "a53b6e868b23a520398eafe8663be51b8865e3dc88c19ced7d883f08ccffe121",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "食べ終えると、%YOU% は少し決まり悪そうに弁当箱を返した。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8ebe50500a75f5ce16004bae8ca72f6e",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "88d3245fdd9319693845228f62912403276505d3739bf1d133f4ac3e86116916",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "走るのは禁止です！",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "23629d0d955e15d24862186f8164a1af",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        0,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "7741bde1b6955e252dd02ce578c1aed07a2e8335eed6f4c4ffe28e009f4e3cf3",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "「遅すぎる！ もう、許せる時間じゃない！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5c62ab9428e35008faa79632c07a63d3",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "b68ed633d53735035131216978157c3e23b588c4b53c8f338a220ede951bc68a",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "%YOU% は、頭を下げているスズカを、かなり厳しく責めた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "34615b02a2b23a3b000dd93eecc68d44",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "67ece19a510dab1dd61a878d351fdaef66393be49598d0762a3cfb1bbb26bce0",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "もう深夜だ。額には薄い汗が残っている。明らかに、今しがた走って戻ってきた顔だった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f7021b2af521adb8e773a25f9d0add7e",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        3,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "bccc0d447d1fccb90905aaa67d14a0e160d180ea87bbe8c5ec124f06cab5f03c",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "「コンビニへ行くと言って、何時間も帰ってこないのは、誰だ！」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "20d3b450292b4a895e590ad4319e00d0",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        4,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "9d9f4932737b1b37a93ce45c4b46a9b310374a94be41821854ac13b9298473e4",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "「すみません……今夜の月が、きれいすぎて……我慢できなくて」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3a31c9253022356903712968200bd8cd",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        5,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "c432190199a1bcd8fedc22935237f2962c1c53233c681ddf078a0626cd3a15e2",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "「だめだ。重罪、許せん。三日間、走るのは禁止だ。家で、しっかり反省しろ」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "921b0703a245985d9bf5079b736944fb",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        6
      ],
      "originalHash": "d287f7b472e259b5930aba9e86463e0810b9ddc2c8ecc0f32b5833761307884a",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "雷に打たれたように、スズカはその場へ力なく座り込んだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "28de451a2705edfaf383e1413abf9a26",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        7
      ],
      "originalHash": "d7d07f7a5c06b5cbc1f5c43476ca0bd854bdd83853fff0eb1e02700e1ce85459",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "すぐに、%SEX%は飛びついて %YOU% の脚に抱きつく。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d8d7ab9bf498cbf49435dfae630becc2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        8,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "4060bc9bea52d362d961b6f75a435f674fe45082bd0678e8900a820d79c01541",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "「だめです……それでは、生きていけません——」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dcf50b13174e311f5b23b9a00b73709d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        9
      ],
      "originalHash": "b2d5f441165d5a0c3fea4132a7935d04ebec401d08f04b5d7538556731440d5e",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "悲嘆するスズカには構わず、%SEX%に脚を抱かれたまま、一歩ずつ寝室へ進んだ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a5c253af5ddae4619e72f157633ba96b",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        10
      ],
      "originalHash": "cf30b70958fae7dd8e72409520412ae2b5b3acd52b2eb2c67078de24cb4df839",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "スズカは素直に腕を解き、軽く身支度をして寝間着に着替える。%YOU% が横になってから、傍へ滑り込んできた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "7e24ba4bf24d697d225c89f591e22977",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        11,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "82907479fa392056284dbba387383b1f1d37c801cd2a5df5bfdb2127c05d5bdd",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "「あの……」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9683c8e77066b3db829d2834139ed6d0",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        12,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "f03198c1aef92598637a6c16ba43afae2298813cd7d4beb0ddf0ce67a7220765",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "「だめだ」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "894e00f6701759f2dfbca433c5535478",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        13,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "6667cb5b4abeecba82b43505d69867267a8896fdfc97c86f99d131f6511d6400",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "「まだ、何も言っていません」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2c6c4a27de575d965330485e93fd1933",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        14,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "5993a17c4bb539e9a6a51d66cc2c6392348e550f5b6a96305e2c7598cbca7757",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "「だめなものはだめだ、スズカ。本当に、心配なんだ」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e4cd2b70fbdc7d79f7974392b54f78a0",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        15,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "984e617061b324d0b90389f9540c91a875dc8be5d44b02099bd1ae8f6bbf636e",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "「……わかりました。大人しくしていますから、%CALLNAME%、怒らないでください……」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "1e4b355e6330dcd9ee5e691773c5407a",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        16
      ],
      "originalHash": "e1cb0a49910bf24973e93d834fc9c8d1d15ac171f1641a3c6453df35fc2cb778",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "分が悪いとわかっているスズカは、横を向いて %YOU% に抱きつき、一緒に眠っていった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "605eb3d4b98915fdeb63f9634336a2b6",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        17,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "40b8fbe5397a79768179eee257860be2ad8f51ff924717ad38b2b8572c3d98d5",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "翌日",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "12155f879c4b79e0fac04e9b116b6e6e",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        18
      ],
      "originalHash": "31b4196ae34ae0c19790ac5b1ca1d0bad9ff85baf12334d69f07d3b2afd7cc8d",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "家へ入った瞬間、%YOU% は跳ね上がった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a88654ee9150c96193d7bc587e27df11",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        19
      ],
      "originalHash": "865ce644cfed485bcaab49e796a01e30e6753ba898f981aae2563f411dd6aed2",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "目の前に、ニンジンハンバーグの山があった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b9989982d3be40687c9fa01d7913279f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "forbid_running",
        "lines",
        20,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "23c0cc2ea8c81f28b2e3924b45a73faf33fda146c9ced001d8934060dfcb5637",
      "sourceFileHash": "73d905c1a903d031c7faa994246e4bc73ddc7d2fc1bc69d026d3c1cef812a407",
      "originalText": "「スズカ？ これは、全部お前が作ったのか」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "365ed314e3ef002b72f8c4ce22b31180",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100200-Silence-Suzuka/daily-2.kojo",
      "key": "forbid_running",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
